          "author": "Yoto",
          "seriestitle": "The Solar System",
          "description": "Check out this free preview of a brand new Yoto Original - The Solar System! \n\nKat and Jamal are in their last year of Solar System Space Camp. Their final mission? A scavenger hunt around all eight planets.\n\nKat and Jamal head to the first of the gas giants - the most giant of all in fact, Jupiter! They need to find the next flag, however there’s one big problem, they can’t actually land on Jupiter. It looks like they will have to choose one of Jupiter’s 80 moons to land on. Join them on the next part of their adventure. \n\nDiscover: Listen to a snippet for free.\nFull Pack: The Solar System is available in the card store now. \nAvailable: Until the end of May. ",
